### list all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### search by title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?title=dun

### add a book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dune",
  "author": "Frank Herbert",
  "isbn": "9780441013593"
}

### add a book with no title, should be rejected with a 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Nobody"
}

### register a member
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Abdi",
  "email": "abdi@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### log in with the right password, should return the member
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abdi@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### log in with the wrong password, should return 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abdi@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### borrow book 1 as member 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/borrowings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "memberId": 1
}

### return borrowing 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/borrowings/1/return

### list member 1's borrowings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/borrowings?memberId=1

### review book 1 as member 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "memberId": 1,
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "A classic"
}

### review with a rating of 9, should be rejected with a 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1,
  "memberId": 1,
  "rating": 9
}

### list reviews for book 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews?bookId=1